[tool] d-01 post_finding {"claim": "Finite-difference log slopes in ln-space (grid spacing 0.2878). At z=0: dln rho/dln r = -1.86, -2.54, -2.93 and dln T/dln r = -0.27, -0.58, -0.91 at 
