**Finding:** CTP across the kinetic-AGN extremes (v_kin=0.1, eps_kin=0.02 vs v_kin=1.2, eps_kin=1.2; other parameters fiducial). At R500, t is the geometric mean of the 0.866 and 1.155 bins and the slope is ln(t2/t1)/0.2877. AGN-min: t(R500)=0.565, dlnT/dlnr=-0.617 at z=0; t=0.490, slope=-0.589 at z=0.4987. AGN-max: t=0.600, slope=-0.573 at z=0; t=0.526, slope=-0.621 at z=0.4987. The feedback spread in t(R500) is 6.0% at z=0 and 7.1% at z=0.4987. The slope spread is 0.04 at z=0 and 0.03 at z=0.4987, and its sign reverses between the two redshifts.
