[tool] d-04 post_finding {"claim": "Fiducial R500 inputs recomputed from the four fiducial CSVs, using finite differences between the 0.866 and 1.155 R500 bins (dln x = 0.2878). At z=0:
[finding] f-012 Fiducial R500 inputs recomputed from the four fiducial CSVs, using finite differences between the 0.866 and 1.155 R500 bins (dln x = 0.2878). At z=0: s_rho = -2
**Finding:** Fiducial R500 inputs recomputed from the four fiducial CSVs, using finite differences between the 0.866 and 1.155 R500 bins (dln x = 0.2878). At z=0: s_rho = -2.545, s_T = -0.583, sum = -3.128, t(R500) = 0.5916 (geometric mean), giving M_th/M500 = (t/2)|sum| = 0.925. At z=0.4987: s_rho = -2.738, s_T = -0.505, sum = -3.243, t = 0.5181, giving M_th/M500 = 0.840. In the FLAMINGO convention, uncorrected b_HSE = (M_HSE - M500)/M500 = -0.075 (z=0) and -0.160 (z=0.4987). The shape-only shift is -9.2%. This reproduces f-004 and f-005.
